Legacy-mode (heirloom) passphrases are eight words drawn from this list. The
viewer will carry the list in 0.2 so that a typed phrase can be matched back to
list words (a capital letter or a one-letter slip never shuts a family member
out). The list is attribution-required material and is credited here in
advance so the requirement is not forgotten. Version 0.1 does not include it.
